# Hiddify app (client): addresses that bypass the VPN (routed Direct).
#
# Copy to config/client/hiddify-bypass.local.txt (gitignored) and put the real
# CIDRs there, one per line. Do not commit server addresses.
# The inverse list (everything NOT bypassed) is in
# config/client/hiddify-allowedips.txt.
# Apply in the client: Settings -> Routing rules -> add rule -> IP CIDR,
# paste the lines without comments, outbound Direct, then reconnect.
10.0.0.0/8
172.16.0.0/16
192.168.0.0/16
